---
title: Secuencia de Telemetría — Sensor → Dashboard
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant FW as Firmware
    participant AHT as AHT21 (I2C)
    participant ENS as ENS160 (I2C)
    participant HTTP as Backend HTTP
    participant MQTT as MQTT Broker
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant SSE as SSE Server
    participant FE as Frontend

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note right of FW: Cada 8s — taskSensors
        FW->>AHT: readTemperature() + readHumidity()
        AHT-->>FW: T=24.5°C, H=85.2%
        FW->>ENS: setTempAndHum(T, H)
        FW->>ENS: readCO2() + readTVOC() + readAQI()
        ENS-->>FW: CO2=420ppm, VOC=15ppb, AQI=1
    end

    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
        Note right of FW: Envío HTTP (principal)
        FW->>HTTP: POST /api/v1/telemetry<br/>{deviceId, temperature, humidity, co2, voc, aqi, ssrState, ...}
        HTTP->>DB: INSERT INTO telemetry
        HTTP-->>FW: 200 OK
    end

    rect rgb(243, 229, 245)
        Note right of FW: Envío MQTT (health/status)
        FW->>MQTT: publish mush2/{id}/health<br/>{freeHeap, minFreeHeap, taskStacks, i2cStatus, sensorStatus}
        MQTT->>HTTP: onMessage health
        HTTP->>DB: INSERT INTO device_health
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note right of FW: Respaldo ThingSpeak
        FW->>TS: HTTP GET field1=T&field2=H&field3=CO2
        TS-->>FW: 200 OK
    end

    rect rgb(243, 229, 245)
        Note right of SSE: Tiempo real → Frontend
        HTTP->>SSE: eventBus.emit('telemetry', data)
        SSE->>FE: event: telemetry<br/>data: {"temperature":24.5,"humidity":85,...}
        FE->>FE: Actualiza Chart.js + gauges
    end
